# Pairs with ReleaseBackedBySnapshot, and reproduces the never-written release
# production had until issue #4523 was fixed (#4535): a never-written leaf that holds
# no snapshot releases its block at its persisted checkpoint, publishing a trim
# entitlement no durable snapshot backs. Reachable with no fault at all. The base
# keeps the block until a capture records coverage, and bounds the release by it.
MODULE: ReleaseBackedBySnapshotNoSnapshotReleasesCheckpoint
TARGET: ReleaseBackedBySnapshot
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a never-written leaf with no snapshot releases at its persisted checkpoint, above any durable coverage
PERTURBS: PublishPin

--- FIND
          THEN MergePin(l, "zero", NeverWrittenRelease(l))
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: with no snapshot the release is the persisted checkpoint.
          THEN MergePin(l, "zero", IF cov[l] < 0 THEN stCp[l] ELSE NeverWrittenRelease(l))
--- END